{"id":"999630947","kind":"answer","title":"背单词时怎样做到背了新单词而不忘背过的旧词？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复的历史","date":"2020-02-05","updated":"2020-02-06","votes":12,"comment_count":8,"minutes":2,"chars":904,"keywords":["间隔重复","记忆稳定性","可提取性","间隔效应","SuperMemo"],"summary":"每一个词背完都不忘是不可能的，这是一个概率问题，涉及两个变量：背词的记忆稳定性和距离上次背词的时间。 记忆一个词一次后，随着时间流逝，你遗忘这个词的概率不断升高，宏观表现就是遗忘曲线（如下图） 这个曲线满足公式 R 表示你能回忆起这个单词的概率，S 表示你对这个词的记忆稳定性，t 表示距离上次记忆的时间。 只要 t 大于 0…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/367321610/answer/999630947","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"jh3zxt0D\">每一个词背完都不忘是不可能的，这是一个概率问题，涉及两个变量：背词的记忆稳定性和距离上次背词的时间。</p><p data-pid=\"9T6h3MS_\">记忆一个词一次后，随着时间流逝，你遗忘这个词的概率不断升高，宏观表现就是遗忘曲线（如下图）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cc204c0a769afb762d308eed1759afaa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3f222f8e13c1b9d850d26f16fd29dd97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a407814bf1d97e061512a7f45514612f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1208\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cc204c0a769afb762d308eed1759afaa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3f222f8e13c1b9d850d26f16fd29dd97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a407814bf1d97e061512a7f45514612f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1208\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"HwJ6tK6i\">这个曲线满足公式</p><p data-pid=\"JDzhAlV4\"><img alt=\"R=e^{-t/S}\" class=\"math-eq\" eeimg=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=R%3De%5E%7B-t%2FS%7D\"/></p><p data-pid=\"9Wf_M9Xo\">R 表示你能回忆起这个单词的概率，S 表示你对这个词的记忆稳定性，t 表示距离上次记忆的时间。</p><p data-pid=\"eegFonLQ\">只要 t 大于 0，R 就小于 1。因此我们想要<b>一定不忘</b>是<b>做不到</b>的。退而求其次，我们应重点提高 S，这样 R 随 t 减小的速度会慢很多，使得我们能在背完单词后<b>很长</b>一段时间内<b>大概率</b>不忘。</p><p data-pid=\"puTe3Pza\">那么怎么提高 S 呢？<b>重复</b>（如下图）。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e47559fcefcb4fd743cf60a652984354_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-9a02c6645c60e3fec13fb00d6b007ca4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5f1e2bc3396187cb0ccc8cd6d6a6193e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1197\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e47559fcefcb4fd743cf60a652984354_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-9a02c6645c60e3fec13fb00d6b007ca4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5f1e2bc3396187cb0ccc8cd6d6a6193e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1197\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"3HDrGAaG\">多次复习可以提高 S，那么怎样用较少的重复实现较高的长期记忆保留讷？<b>间隔重复</b>（如下图）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-934399b249f646388a9e6a82c8b7f473_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-59f792af5a846a1fae48e1777651927f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-50b26f6aa6ad245ee3e844d04dc1442e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-934399b249f646388a9e6a82c8b7f473_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-59f792af5a846a1fae48e1777651927f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-50b26f6aa6ad245ee3e844d04dc1442e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"SAv_59QW\">间隔重复，先得重复，才有间隔而言。但是高频的重复并不是人人都能坚持，而且也很浪费时间。那么该怎么确定这个间隔呢？</p><p data-pid=\"eyTyUAl6\">设定一个 R 的阈值，比如 90%，当 R 随着时间递减，等于 90% 时我们开始复习。</p><p data-pid=\"efSMrDrG\">由于 R 是一个指数函数，随着 S 提高，每次递减到 90% 的 t 会不断增加，这就是间隔重复的一个特点：越生疏的重复得越多，越熟悉的重复得越少。这也非常符合常理，同时也节省了我们的时间，提高了效率。</p><p data-pid=\"I2poDvlP\">但是，理论很丰满，现实却很骨感。谁能给自己每个背过的词计算遗忘的概率？还要更新参数的值。或许背几个单词还能算的过来，但是对于记忆大量单词，靠人力已经无法解决。</p><p data-pid=\"BV4l1VNX\">怎么办？这时候只能借助计算机的力量了。我推荐 Anki —— 开源、自由、免费的卡片式间隔重复软件。</p><p data-pid=\"YOgMFyMr\">用 Anki 做的英语单词卡，Anki 会根据每张卡片的记忆情况计算下一次复习的间隔（如下图）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-fb0f5ebda89ea776cb53741f5f3f4369_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5b2209c04aa22ca9d12854947574167\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2f434e2683e7246442160873563cae36_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1920\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-fb0f5ebda89ea776cb53741f5f3f4369_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5b2209c04aa22ca9d12854947574167\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2f434e2683e7246442160873563cae36_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1920\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"k01lCKpi\">每一张卡片都有独立的复习数据（如下图）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-fb64e18db61755d63a24f0f84d95e43f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4b6058fe1137fd5e2acb3c34bcfa92ae\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-4cc5e0fc7f33e720bc51a6449e6049e2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"978\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-fb64e18db61755d63a24f0f84d95e43f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-4b6058fe1137fd5e2acb3c34bcfa92ae\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4cc5e0fc7f33e720bc51a6449e6049e2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"978\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"BjbDmFEk\">我已经用 Anki 两年多了，下面是我的统计数据：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c1b4faad665d25ce1938acf7c6403935_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-87e7106d734f8b4394881e3073d1f627\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9756f1b6ab1d54d673f8aebe27a736a6_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1179\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c1b4faad665d25ce1938acf7c6403935_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-87e7106d734f8b4394881e3073d1f627\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9756f1b6ab1d54d673f8aebe27a736a6_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9f6fff40cfdffc776c6cfb89dd0e1a2f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-dd2354ec309d3b69764ca5ded5b4832a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-92a25dac5f60d99e777d5bddfe226cbf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1269\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9f6fff40cfdffc776c6cfb89dd0e1a2f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-dd2354ec309d3b69764ca5ded5b4832a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-92a25dac5f60d99e777d5bddfe226cbf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1269\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"0xlL0j9g\">我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2e8a109841199b0a18e70ae7bd16ea66_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"535\" data-image-width=\"1220\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：B 站 Ankidroid 视频教程与电子书(全平台教程)快速通道</a><p data-pid=\"GDEQzi1l\">希望对背单词有困难的朋友们有所帮助。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"YWop6CH1\">补充一下，这个模型只是一个简化版本，继续深挖还需要考虑记忆内容的难度、记忆稳定性的迭代公式等等，这篇文章会更全面一些：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-810e0b24320f5cb2b6a3b357c474e014_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"753\" data-image-width=\"1402\" data-tm-id=\"99505568\" href=\"#/post/99505568\">叶峻峣：05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"99505568","title":"05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":20,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"179076885","title":"记忆的两个组成成分|浓缩通俗版","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":75,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"579476637","title":"记忆的双组分模型","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"274352214","title":"遗忘曲线","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":22,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"559819340","title":"记忆可提取性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"961619758","title":"背单词的过程中，如何形成牢固的记忆？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":30,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 30 赞同"},{"id":"959753274","title":"手机上的anki app 复习的间隔时间可以改吗 在哪里改？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":40,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 40 赞同"},{"id":"1319708582","title":"按遗忘曲线复习效率更高吗？为什么我觉得没什么效果呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":63,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 63 赞同"},{"id":"1804949616","title":"如何结合遗忘曲线记单词？",